end

subgraph changes["🔄 Key Changes"]
    c1["Claim (XRC) → REMOVED\nXR is now the developer's object"]
    c2["Cluster-scoped XR → NAMESPACED XR"]
    c3["Cluster-scoped MRs → NAMESPACED MRs"]
    c4["claimNames in XRD → REMOVED"]
    c5["connectionSecretKeys → REMOVED\nCompose a Secret explicitly"]
    c6["Native patch-and-transform → REMOVED\nFunctions pipeline only"]
    c7["ControllerConfig → REMOVED\nDeploymentRuntimeConfig"]
end

